  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Sense Motive 7 ranks, Investigation sphere.</p>\n<p>You adopt this approach as a standard action and choose a single (analyze) talent you possess. Once per turn, you can analyze a creature you can perceive using the chosen (analyze) talent as a free action to attempt a simple analysis, or a swift action to attempt to gain a detailed analysis. You must pay any costs associated with using the (analyze) talent as normal.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/investigation#toc44\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
